script = ExtResource("1_sc013")
id = 13
name = "Setsuna Shoumetsu"
element = "Electric"
description = "INSTA-KILL MINION CHECK. The boss summons a wave of 3 Nirvana Engine minions and begins the cast. The party has ONE ROUND to destroy ALL 3. If even one is still standing when the boss's next turn comes around, it resolves and EVERY PLAYER DIES - no save, defence ignored. Destroying all 3 breaks the cast; a fresh wave spawns and the check repeats. The minions themselves (no HP, one Fire / one Ice / one Nature, killed outright by a matching-element hit) are configured SEPARATELY. Countdown-driven: order 99 and weight 0, never weight-rolled. trigger_window_rounds = 1 is the round they get; trigger_threshold_int = 3 is the number of minions that must die."
